{"id":"b222e27484042250","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence.md","title":"有效开补集与可计算树的统一转换","display":"thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence — 有效开补集与可计算树的统一转换","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence","aliases":["20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence"],"display":"thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence — 有效开补集与可计算树的统一转换","chapter":"8","section":"8.1–8.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorems 8.1.2, 8.2.2；Corollary 8.2.3","source_printed_pages":[166,167],"source_pdf_pages":[199,200],"depends_on":["[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-finite-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence — 有效开补集与可计算树的统一转换"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.1–8.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorems 8.1.2, 8.2.2；Corollary 8.2.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>166</span><span>167</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>199</span><span>200</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s\\subseteq S_{s+1}\">\\(S_s\\subseteq S_{s+1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\bigcup_sS_s\">\\(S=\\bigcup_sS_s\\)</span>，各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s\">\\(S_s\\)</span> 有限且统一可计算。指标版本使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{e,s}:=\\{\\sigma:\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)\\in W_{e,s}\\}\">\\(S_{e,s}:=\\{\\sigma:\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)\\in W_{e,s}\\}\\)</span>；一般闭类表示的闭性前提在断言中明示。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^\\omega\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_S\">\\(T_S\\)</span> 是相对于本条已固定阶段序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(S_s)_{s\\in\\omega}\">\\((S_s)_{s\\in\\omega}\\)</span> 的局部别名，不声称只由最终集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 决定。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(s)=\\operatorname{fcode}(\\operatorname{code}[S_s])\">\\(g(s)=\\operatorname{fcode}(\\operatorname{code}[S_s])\\)</span>；这明确“统一可计算有限枚举”使用可有效取得全部成员的有限集编码。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class\\text{-}tree\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sigma01Class}(2^\\omega\\setminus C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OpenTree}(P):=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\neg\\exists\\rho\\in P(|\\sigma|)\\ (\\rho\\preceq\\sigma)\\},\\\\\nT_S:=\\operatorname{OpenTree}((S_s)_{s\\in\\omega}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T_S)\\land\\operatorname{code}[T_S]\\in\\mathcal R\n\\land[T_S]=2^\\omega\\setminus\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho],\\\\\n\\exists c\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e,z\\in\\omega\\\n[\\varphi_{c(e)}(z)\\downarrow=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[\\operatorname{OpenTree}((S_{e,s})_{s\\in\\omega})]}(z)]\\quad(S_e:=\\{\\sigma:\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)\\in W_e\\}),\\\\\nT_C:=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:C\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Closed}(C)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T_C)\\land C=[T_C].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class\\text{-}tree\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sigma01Class}(2^\\omega\\setminus C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OpenTree}(P):=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\neg\\exists\\rho\\in P(|\\sigma|)\\ (\\rho\\preceq\\sigma)\\},\\\\\nT_S:=\\operatorname{OpenTree}((S_s)_{s\\in\\omega}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T_S)\\land\\operatorname{code}[T_S]\\in\\mathcal R\n\\land[T_S]=2^\\omega\\setminus\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho],\\\\\n\\exists c\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e,z\\in\\omega\\\n[\\varphi_{c(e)}(z)\\downarrow=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[\\operatorname{OpenTree}((S_{e,s})_{s\\in\\omega})]}(z)]\\quad(S_e:=\\{\\sigma:\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)\\in W_e\\}),\\\\\nT_C:=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:C\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Closed}(C)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T_C)\\land C=[T_C].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_S\">\\(T_S\\)</span> 的成员关系只检查一个有限阶段，故可计算。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\preceq\\sigma\\in T_S\">\\(\\tau\\preceq\\sigma\\in T_S\\)</span>，单调枚举给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{|\\tau|}\\subseteq S_{|\\sigma|}\">\\(S_{|\\tau|}\\subseteq S_{|\\sigma|}\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in T_S\">\\(\\tau\\in T_S\\)</span>。路径若有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 入枚举且长度足够大的阶段会被排除；没有这样的前缀则所有前缀都在树中。反向，可计算树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的补集串集合可计算，其柱并恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\\setminus[T]\">\\(2^\\omega\\setminus[T]\\)</span>。转换均由给定指标有效执行。</p>\n<p>一般闭类的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_C\">\\(T_C\\)</span> 向下闭合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq[T_C]\">\\(C\\subseteq[T_C]\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\notin C\">\\(X\\notin C\\)</span>，开补集中存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的柱邻域，该前缀不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_C\">\\(T_C\\)</span>，故反向也成立。空类对应空树；全空间对应满树。原书紧致性证明中一般闭集的树不能无条件称为可计算树。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 166–167 / PDF 199–200。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据