x":"S_{e,s}:=\\{\\sigma:\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)\\in W_{e,s}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathcal P(2^{<\\omega})^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"T_S","display":false},{"tex":"(S_s)_{s\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"g(s)=\\operatorname{fcode}(\\operatorname{code}[S_s])","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class\\text{-}tree\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sigma01Class}(2^\\omega\\setminus C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OpenTree}(P):=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:\\neg\\exists\\rho\\in P(|\\sigma|)\\ (\\rho\\preceq\\sigma)\\},\\\\\nT_S:=\\operatorname{OpenTree}((S_s)_{s\\in\\omega}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T_S)\\land\\operatorname{code}[T_S]\\in\\mathcal R\n\\land[T_S]=2^\\omega\\setminus\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho],\\\\\n\\exists c\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e,z\\in\\omega\\\n[\\varphi_{c(e)}(z)\\downarrow=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[\\operatorname{OpenTree}((S_{e,s})_{s\\in\\omega})]}(z)]\\quad(S_e:=\\{\\sigma:\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)\\in W_e\\}),\\\\\nT_C:=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:C\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Closed}(C)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T_C)\\land C=[T_C].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"T_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\preceq\\sigma\\in T_S","display":false},{"tex":"S_{|\\tau|}\\subseteq S_{|\\sigma|}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in T_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega\\setminus[T]","display":false},{"tex":"T_C","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq[T_C]","display":false},{"tex":"X\\notin C","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"T_C","display":false}],"bytes":3297,"backlinks":[{"id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"有效类的载体为 $2^\\omega$，与自然数集合的算术层级区分。这里以可计算树定义 $\\Pi^0_1$ 类，以 c.e. 柱表示定义 $\\Sigma^0_1$ 类；两种表示的补集等价及指标转换由 [[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]] 证明。该链接是后续证明导航，不把表示定理反向列为定义依赖。一般闭类不自动拥有可计算树表示。"},{"id":"cc21d215609a3083","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-basis]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-thm-simple-exists]]；see [[20-df-effective-immune]]；see [[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]；see [[20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper]]。"},{"id":"e98d69d59488c0ae","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-thm-effective-compactness]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-424","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]] — 章 8；直接提供者 6 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-424","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]"},{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"重点入口：编码与模型 [[20-df-strings]]、[[20-df-tmcomp]]、[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；对象与接口 [[20-df-tred]]、[[20-df-characteristic]]、[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；逻辑 [[20-df-formula]]、[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]、[[20-df-pa]]；树与构造 [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]、[[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]；博弈 [[20-df-gale-stewart]]、[[20-df-bm-strategy]]；良基递归 [[20-df-kleene-O]]、[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]。"}],"outgoing":["b73290a0af01d44f","4ef1aee16db6b308","e343870c773cb68e","d6dc5974baa6f8a5","8ba6597a854c206f","59004ac6d23e86f8"]}